\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-13.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-14.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-15.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-16.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-17.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-18.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-18.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-19.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-19.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-20.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-21.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-21.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-22.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-22.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-23.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-23.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-24.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-24.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-25.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-25.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-26.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-26.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\">    </div><div class=\"media-row__item\">    </div> </div>\n<p><strong>VYPLNĚNÝ UKÁZKOVÝ DOTAZNÍK</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-27.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-27.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\">    </div><div class=\"media-row__item\">    </div> </div> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Human-Selected Random Numbers</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> April 2018 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>In this project, a questionnaire was distributed to several people. The participants wrote down 100 random numbers between 1 and 100 that came to mind. I then entered this data into a computer and created one graph for each questionnaire. The horizontal x-axis represents the order of the individual numbers, and the vertical y-axis represents the values of the selected numbers. The blue graph was generated by a computer, specifically a random number generator. When comparing all the graphs as a whole, it is evident that each test subject has a unique graph with their own pattern of number selection. It can also be observed that certain nearly identical cycles recur in many graphs (mostly in the form of a gradual increase and decrease in numbers).</p>\n<p><strong>NUMBERS SELECTED BY THE RANDOM NUMBER GENERATOR</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<p><strong>NUMBERS CHOSEN BY PEOPLE</strong></p>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-6.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-6.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-7.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-7.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-8.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-8.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-9.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-9.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-10.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-10.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-11.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-12.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-12.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-13.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-13.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-14.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-14.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-15.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-15.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-16.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-16.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-17.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-17.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-18.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-18.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-19.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-19.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div>\n<div class=\"media-row \"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/nahodna-cisla-zvolena-clovekem-obr-20.jpg\"